widgets_values":["integrated_multimodal_description\nLive-action, cinematic, a low-angle medium-wide shot frames a man and a woman advancing together through a flooded concrete utility vault, matching <Picture 1> exactly at the opening frame. The man (reference 2) is on the left in a long brown leather coat over a black shirt, mid-forties, weathered face, short dirty-blond hair, greying stubble, both hands locked around a raised pistol sighted forward past the camera. The woman (picture 1) is on the right and half a pace behind him, early thirties, olive-tan skin, long wavy black hair, a black cropped leather vest over a black crop top, a revolver up in a two-handed grip. A caged pendant lamp burns hard white above them and a red emergency lamp throws red across the right side of the frame. They advance in step through the standing water, boots throwing spray, his coat swinging behind him, her hair lifting with the motion, both heads sweeping the corridor ahead as they clear it. The camera holds a Push with small amplitude at slow speed toward them, the pipework converging overhead.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.600, the camera cuts to a tight low-angle close-up of the woman (S1) as she keeps moving forward. Red light from the emergency lamp rakes across one cheek and the white pendant lamp catches her eyes. Her jaw is set, her eyes flick to the man off camera-left, then back to the corridor ahead. She (S1) says <d>[English] Thirty seconds.</d> Her hair swings across her cheek as her head turns and she pushes on. The camera Tracks with her at slow speed with small amplitude.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to a matching tight low-angle close-up of the man (S2), weathered face, greying stubble, short dirty-blond hair, jaw tight, sweat and grime across his temple, the white pendant lamp hard across his brow and red light along the side of his neck. He glances off camera-right toward her, then forward again down the corridor, and his grip shifts on the pistol. He (S2) says <d>[English] Then run faster.</d> The camera Tracks with him at slow speed with small amplitude.\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.300, the camera cuts to a wide low shot taken from behind the two of them at floor level as they break into a hard sprint away from camera down the flooded corridor. Their backs fill the lower half of the frame, his coat streaming out behind him, her boots kicking up sheets of water that catch the overhead lamps. Concrete walls and pipe runs rush past on both sides, the red lamp glare falls away behind them, and a lit doorway waits at the far end of the corridor. They reach it as the shot ends. The camera Tracks forward with large amplitude at fast speed, chasing them down the corridor.\noverall_soundscape\nBoots slamming through standing water, heavy splashes and fast running footfalls echoing hard off concrete, the low industrial hum of pipework, a distant alarm klaxon, water dripping, leather and fabric shifting with hard movement.\nnon_diegetic_music\nN/A"],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"}],"links":[[250,120,0,121,1,"VAE"],[251,119,0,122,1,"VAE"],[252,127,0,124,0,"MODEL"],[253,129,0,125,0,"NOISE"],[254,126,0,125,1,"GUIDER"],[255,123,0,125,2,"SAMPLER"],[256,124,0,125,3,"SIGMAS"],[257,127,0,126,0,"MODEL"],[258,122,0,130,0,"IMAGE"],[259,121,0,130,1,"AUDIO"],[260,130,0,92,0,"VIDEO"],[261,132,0,131,0,"FLOAT"],[270,136,0,126,1,"CONDITIONING"],[271,136,1,125,4,"LATENT"],[272,128,0,136,0,"CLIP"],[273,119,0,136,1,"VAE"],[274,120,0,136,2,"VAE"],[275,131,1,136,13,"INT"],[276,115,0,136,11,"INT"],[277,115,1,136,12,"INT"],[278,137,0,136,3,"IMAGE"],[279,138,0,136,10,"STRING"],[280,125,0,122,0,"LATENT"],[281,125,0,121,0,"LATENT"],[282,139,0,136,4,"IMAGE"],[283,141,0,136,5,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"Models","bounding":[-1520,4840,700,670],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":2,"title":"Sampling","bounding":[-280,4840,690,670],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"Conditioning","bounding":[-790,4840,480,670],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":4,